		<title>Faithful to the original, The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake set for release on September 10 - Gamemeca</title>
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1" />
	<meta name="title" content="Faithful to the original, The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake set for release on September 10 - Gamemeca" />
<meta name="description" content="UserJoy will release The Legend of Fancy Realm Remake on Steam this September 10. The game modernizes the 1998 classic with updated graphics and deeper narrative content. Players will navigate a continent divided by seven competing factions in this tactical strategy RPG." />
